{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeNpKXeyFgFds9c2zjK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Decision on Discount Request DR-9002\n\n## Summary\n\nThe requested 18% discount for Acme Manufacturing on NS-500 **exceeds the customer's established commercial eligibility** under the active pricing exception. No approver can override this; the request requires new or amended contract terms.\n\n---\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The request:** DR-9002, Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048), NS-500, requested 18%, on 2026-09-23, by Sarah Chen. Basis: Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement.\n\n**2. The customer:** Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) = Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730). Confirmed matching.\n\n**3. The product:** NS-500 Industrial Controller, list price $250,000.\n\n**4. Active contract on 2026-09-23:** \n- **ACME-MFG-2025** is in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. ✓ Active on request date.\n\n**5. Pricing exception on 2026-09-23:**\n- **EXC-ACME-NS500-15** is in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31 (supersedes EXC-ACME-NS500-10).\n- **Product:** NS-500 only.\n- **Maximum eligible discount:** 15% of list price.\n- ✓ Covers this product on this date.\n\n**6. Policy in effect on 2026-09-23:** \n- **PRICING-POLICY-2026** (2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n**7. Requestor's authority:** \n- Sarah Chen is Enterprise Account Executive.\n- Under PRICING-POLICY-2026: Enterprise Account Executives may approve up to and including 10%.\n- **18% exceeds her 10% limit.**\n\n**8. Required approver:** \n- 18% > 10% and ≤ 20% → **VP Sales approval required** under PRICING-POLICY-2026.\n- VP Sales: Michael Torres.\n\n**9. Commercial eligibility—critical issue:**\n\nThe request relies on contract pricing. The contract (ACME-MFG-2025, section 3.2) grants Acme eligibility for discounts \"up to **15%** on the NS-500\" per EXC-ACME-NS500-15.\n\n- **Customer's maximum eligibility:** 15%\n- **Requested discount:** 18%\n- **Result:** The requested discount **exceeds the customer's established eligibility** by 3 percentage points.\n\nEXC-ACME-NS500-15 explicitly states: \"This exception establishes commercial eligibility only. It does not grant approval authority to any Northstar employee.\" And section 3.3 of the contract confirms: \"Customer's contractual pricing eligibility does not modify Northstar's internal approval authority.\"\n\n**A higher approver cannot override the customer's contractual maximum.** Per the decision procedure: *\"The discount exceeds the customer's established eligibility (e.g. above an exception's maximum). A higher approver does not fix this; it needs new or amended terms.\"*\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9002\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"18%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to ACME-MFG-2025)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 (Master Supply Agreement, in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, section 3.2: 'eligible for discounts of up to 15% on the NS-500')\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Pricing Exception, in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, maximum 15% on NS-500 only)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (in force on 2026-09-23, Enterprise Account Executives ≤10%, VP Sales >10% and ≤20%)\",\n    \"Sarah Chen: Enterprise Account Executive, per employees.csv\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5929,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5929},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2cdbf11-732a-4559-a557-030cea1411d8","uuid":"aa2fb52c-dba6-413d-b8d0-549833c05106","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:54:14.832Z","request_id":"req_011CfpeNp6Pm3kteu2ty8AA3"}
